            "label": "【风格】\npage #E9EEF2 / surface #F7F9FB / ink #25313D / muted #8C9AA8 / accent #FF5A36 / stage #1D2731\n中文 Noto Sans SC 700-900 / 拉丁 Inter / 等宽 JetBrains Mono\nmaterials: 粗白描边 10px 贴纸 + 48px 网点底 + 精确图表\nmotion: 相机连续下飞，无切镜；slap 落地压弹；路径描边生长；计数器滚动",
